# Case: Native settings screenshots for the parallel settings delivery
# Mode: native
# Purpose: Capture the actual settings composition for diagnostics, storage, appearance, permission guidance and portable backup.
# Steps:
#   Start an isolated production desktop, visit each implemented settings section, reveal its controls and retain native window captures.
# Expected:
#   Settings controls render in the live composition; the real service supplies diagnostic and cache values; screenshots and a continuous recording are retained.
# Forbidden:
#   Personal profiles, system clipboard access, telemetry uploads, permission requests, file dialogs, invented pixels or claims of completed update/paste acceptance.

start
ui-wait listItem 设置…
ui-click listItem 设置…
ui-wait listItem 通用
screenshot general
ui-wait listItem 诊断与隐私
ui-click listItem 诊断与隐私
